<p>Iran executed three men on March 19 after convicting them in cases tied to protests that broke out in January, according to state media cited by Reuters and other outlets. Multiple reports said one of those executed was 19-year-old wrestler Saleh Mohammadi, whom CBS News said two sources identified as a member of Iran&#x27;s national wrestling team. Rights groups said the men were denied fair trials and that authorities extracted confessions under torture. Multiple outlets described the executions as the first reported carrying out of death sentences connected to the January protests. The case has renewed attention on longstanding criticism from rights campaigners, who accuse Iranian authorities of relying on coerced confessions and limiting defendants&#x27; ability to defend themselves in court.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/qoh8MQJQX_AxTKNL3nuq-OKLFL-4vDBohjGtEhC3BEvneGaoMyGVALVIY7a7CQPrZpcm3mgL-7EaPIa_-VxLC128Wp-XSeveHlF6wnzohNKmrPGwEcgrm04_9W_rpJDz2zamUbkbMfPB0rqy0zlv_ZO7ob-imeSJ12iZ1cRAmvnNzEWZ1O1sgLEp8anDCzQzd8PtpvOSJMkN4BknH0cr-Qk0bQ' alt='Image used with coverage of Iran&#x27;s execution of three men detained during January protests' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Athlete profile: Euronews said rights groups identified Saleh Mohammadi as a teenager who competed in international wrestling events.</li><li>Characterization of the unrest: Euronews described the January demonstrations as anti-government protests.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Iranian state media: State media said authorities had executed three people arrested over the January protests, reflecting the official account of the cases. (<a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/iran-executes-three-individuals-arrested-over-january-protests-state-media-2026-03-19/'>Reuters</a>)</li><li>Rights groups: Rights groups said the three men were executed without a fair trial and that authorities obtained their confessions under torture. (<a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/19/iran-hangs-three-men-in-first-executions-over-january-anti-government-protests'>Euronews</a>)</li><li>CBS News sources: Two sources told CBS News that Saleh Mohammadi, identified as a young member of Iran&#x27;s national wrestling team, was among those executed. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/iran-execution-teen-wrestler-january-protests/'>CBS News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/iran-execution-teen-wrestler-january-protests/'>Iran hangs 3, including teen wrestler, in first executions over Jan. protests</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/03/19/iran-hangs-three-men-in-first-executions-over-january-anti-government-protests'>Iran hangs three men, including 19-year-old wrestler, in first executions over January protests</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/iran-executes-three-men-detained-during-january-protests/article70761060.ece'>Iran executes three men detained during January protests</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/middle-east/iran-executes-three-individuals-arrested-over-january-protests-state-media-2026-03-19/'>Iran executes three men arrested during protests last January.</a> - reuters.com</li></ul>